  "contribution": {
    "value": "Llama 3 is a herd of dense Transformer foundation models (8B, 70B, 405B parameters) with up to 128K context, pre-trained on 15.6T tokens, openly released and competitive with GPT-4.",
    "ev": {
      "page": 1,
      "section": "Llama Team, AI @ Meta^(1)",
      "quote": "This paper presents a new set of foundation models, called Llama 3. It is a herd of language models that natively support multilinguality, coding, reasoning, and tool usage. Our largest model is a dense Transformer with 405B parameters and a context window of up to 128K tokens.",
